WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.724
Cat wrote a note.

2
00:00:09.725 --> 00:00:12.616
"No one loves me.

3
00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:18.118
I am running away."

4
00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:25.616
Then Cat left the barn.

5
00:00:25.617 --> 00:00:34.391
The friends saw the note.

6
00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:38.552
"Cat ran away!" Cow cried.

7
00:00:38.553 --> 00:00:49.084
"We did not let Cat play," said Dog.

8
00:00:49.085 --> 00:00:54.353
"We said mean things to Cat," said Bat.

9
00:00:54.354 --> 00:01:06.589
"I miss Cat!" said Pig.

10
00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:11.152
"Cat is not good at catch," said Dog.

11
00:01:11.153 --> 00:01:15.064
"But she is good at other things."

12
00:01:15.065 --> 00:01:21.865
"Cat is good at running," said Bat.

13
00:01:21.866 --> 00:01:27.983
"Cat is good at sleeping," said Cow.

14
00:01:27.984 --> 00:01:39.590
"Cat is good at sharing," said Pig.

15
00:01:39.591 --> 00:01:42.939
"Yes," said Dog.

16
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.832
"And she is good at—"

17
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:47.018
Boom!

18
00:01:47.019 --> 00:01:49.787
The barn door opened.

19
00:01:49.788 --> 00:01:53.238
In came Cat!

20
00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:59.892
"I am good at being friends," she said.

21
00:01:59.893 --> 00:02:06.868
"I missed everyone," said Cat.

22
00:02:06.869 --> 00:02:14.028
"So I came back."

23
00:02:14.029 --> 00:02:29.948
"We are a good team," said Pig.

